      "content": "income augmentation... how? more hours? more stress? it's just more fuel for the fire. there's no version of this where the math actually works. i look at it and it's just a net loss every single month. it feels like i'm just an extra decimal point in some massive equation that's designed to fail. sometimes i think the only way to actually win is to just stop playing the game entirely. to just stop the cycle so it doesn't keep draining everything i am.",
